      "code": "/-- **SAT → DHC₂.** A nonempty CNF is satisfiable iff the digraph of its tokens has a directed\nHamiltonian cycle. -/\ntheorem sat_iff_dhc {φ : CNF} (h : φ ≠ []) : φ.Satisfiable ↔ DHC (ofList φ.tokens).dig := by"
